Description: Performs isotropy test for random fields observed on regular grids.
    Supports multivariate and abstract data. Provides efficient C++ implementations 
    to evaluate directional dependencies across spatial lags using standard or 
    user-defined objective functions. Includes diagnostic visualizations.
